            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Methods, apparatuses, decoders, and computer programs for audio coding are provided. Responsive to a bad frame being indicated, it is determined that a parameter memory is corrupted. Responsive to a bad frame not being indicated decoding multichannel parameters. Responsive to the parameter memory being corrupted, it is determined, based on the location measure, whether the reconstructed sound source is stable and predominantly concentrated in a subset of channels of multichannels of the received multichannel signal. Responsive to the reconstructed sound source being concentrated in the subset of channels of the multichannels and being stable, replacing decoded multichannel parameters with stored multichannel parameters.</p>
            </abstract>
